     ppkkgg__oouuttddaatteedd — compare installed packages and the ports tree

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ppkkgg__oouuttddaatteedd [--mmqqvvxx]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     ppkkgg__oouuttddaatteedd checks installed packages and compares them to the ports
     tree.  It displays packages that may need updating.  Typical output is a
     subdirlist with comments, suitable for bulk building.

     Options are as follows:

     --mm             Causes ppkkgg__oouuttddaatteedd to always display the progress meter
                    in cases it would not do so by default.

     --qq             Quick check, only verifies the names and not full update
                    signatures.  Use is discouraged.

     --vv             Verbose mode.  Does not do anything yet.

     --xx             Disable progress meter.

